"texts":{"menu:6056240:1":{"text":"仕事終わりの一杯が楽しみだぜ。","source_cn":"这趟活干完后一定要去喝一杯。","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人格瑞":{"text":"ドワーフのゲイリー","source":"矮人格瑞","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13222070.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222070","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322207001:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様、ちょうどいいところに……","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C4A737C975DB772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322207002:1":{"text":"先ほど、焦った様子で<style=\"highlight\">セントキンガ教会</style>へ向かう修道士の姿を見かけました。向こうで何かあったのかもしれません。","source_cn":"我刚才看到一个修士急匆匆地往<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65DB5D106A9C577A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322207003:1":{"text":"私の代わりに、様子を見に行っていただけますか？","source_cn":"你能帮我去看看是什么情况吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFD4805CE6CE864D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"カレリーナ","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13222080.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1322208001:0":{"text":"修道士さんがいました！","source_cn":"果然有修士在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C08B986AD9F05AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322208002:0":{"text":"一緒にいるのはドワーフ？何があったのか聞いてみましょう！","source_cn":"矮人也在？快去问问他们发生了什么事吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2642787F0789B090","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13222090.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322209001:1":{"text":"この教会は長いこと修繕されていなくて……先日の大雪で梁（はり）が酷く損傷したので、急いで職人さんを呼んだのです。","source_cn":"圣金嘉教堂年久失修，前些日子下了场大雪，现在房梁岌岌可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB24AF5EA601DFE79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322209002:1":{"text":"ですが、建材を運ぶ人手が足りなくて……","source_cn":"可是教堂的人手太少了，根本搬运不来那么多建材。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF5BAF34EB8EA07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1322209002":{"text":"ですが、建材を運ぶ人手が足りなくて……","source_cn":"可是教堂的人手太少了，根本搬运不来那么多建材。","stat